# Code owners review changes in their area. The "main - protected" ruleset that
# bootstrap creates makes their review required. Use teams, not people; a team
# needs write access to the repository, and bootstrap grants it to
# platform-engineering. The last matching line wins.

# Everything else: your team. Uncomment and set your team's slug.
# *            @EG2development/your-team

# The pipeline, CI/CD identities and bootstrap decide what runs with deploy
# rights, so Platform Engineering reviews changes to them.
/cloudbuild/   @EG2development/platform-engineering
/cicd/         @EG2development/platform-engineering
/scripts/      @EG2development/platform-engineering
/.github/      @EG2development/platform-engineering
